00000004:             ; ; Definitions
00000004:             ; ; Maria-Ioana Dicu
00000004:             ; ; 1 May 2026
00000004:             ; ;
00000004:             ; ; Shared constants used by the Exercise 7 operating-system code, trap handler,
00000004:             ; ; timer setup, interrupt controller and memory-mapped I/O routines.
00000004:             ; ;
00000004:             ; ; This file contains only compile-time constants. It does not reserve memory or
